<PageLayout title="About the business"><main id="main"><Intro label="About TemVora" title="A direct connection, from start to finish." copy="Websites, documents, and IT support for businesses and homes."/><section class="shell page-content content-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">HELLO, I’M JAYLAN.</p><h2>The person behind <em><Wordmark inline/>.</em></h2><p class="lead">I help turn your plans, notes, and technical problems into something you can work with.</p><p>I created <Wordmark inline/> to bring design, document work, and practical IT support together. You can talk to me directly about what you need.</p><p>I’ll ask about your goals, what you already have, and what you want to manage yourself. Then we can agree on the scope and next steps.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK TOGETHER</p><ol class="rule-list"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Start with what you need.</h3><p>Tell me about the project, who it is for, and what a useful result would look like.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Agree on the approach.</h3><p>Work through the options, deliverables, cost, and timing before the work starts.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Build and review.</h3><p>I’ll prepare the work, check the details, and make space for your feedback.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><h3>Make the handoff useful.</h3><p>Know who owns your accounts, how to make agreed updates, and where to get support.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><Invitation/></main></PageLayout>